      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNDER ANESTHETIC (7) lines up chasing another win after getting around the 515m at this track in a strong 29.74 two back then following up with a 30.39 win at Taree Super Track over 525m last time. Can measure up again if runs up to recent times. ZIPPING VIPER (1) was out of the placings last time when sixth at this track (30.39) but scored five back at this track (35.29). Solid record here at the distance winning six races. Goes very well from this draw with four wins and three minor placings from 10 starts. Shapes as one to consider. DIGGER SURE CAN (5) was strongly fancied last time but ran below expectations when fifth (29.99), beaten 2.75 lengths. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Key runner on best form. SMOOTH WHITE (2) is always hard to beat when he races here at this trip.",
